{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105160","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110516001:1":{"text":"おめでとう。そなたらは見事知恵を働かせ、団結してクモたちを撃退した。","source_cn":"恭喜诸位运用智慧和团结合作，击败了那些蜘蛛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EED656A3228AAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110516002:1":{"text":"さあ、この扉をくぐり、勝者の証を手に入れるがいい。","source_cn":"请进入这扇大门，收下属于你们的信物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFC34FC18C196564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110516003:1":{"text":"英霊が……消えた。","source_cn":"英灵……消失了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB129A6E486FB2A94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110516004:1":{"text":"行こう、今は証を手に入れるのが先決だ。","source_cn":"走吧，先去拿信物要紧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC98C53EE8502EF63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110516005:1":{"text":"セトスさんは入らないの？","source_cn":"赛特斯大人，不进去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB85FC0A3C1FA85C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110516006:1":{"text":"今回の勝者はお前たちだ。俺に戦利品を手にする資格はない。","source_cn":"这次的胜利者是你们，自然该你们拿到战利品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC654579FC31F8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110516007:1":{"text":"負けを認めるのは弱さにあらず。俺は規則と結果を重んじるたちでな。","source_cn":"认输并非懦弱，而是对规则的尊重。我尊重结果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E0CDA298E27896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110516008:1":{"text":"勇士の道は違えど、行き着く先は同じだ。戦いを求める者どうし……いずれまたどこかで会えるだろう。","source_cn":"勇者之道，殊途同归。追求战斗的强者……终会在某处再见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC640F0EEB8A99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1110516008":{"text":"勇士の道は違えど、行き着く先は同じだ。戦いを求める者どうし……いずれまたどこかで会えるだろう。","source_cn":"勇者之道，殊途同归。追求战斗的强者……终会在某处再见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC640F0EEB8A99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110516009:1":{"text":"彼の言葉には共感できる。","source_cn":"我倒是不否认这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1653EB877952E46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110516010:1":{"text":"セトスさんへの見方がすこし変わったかも……","source_cn":"我对赛特斯大人的心情突然复杂起来了……","status":"matched","hash